The engine registers each resource OBJECT via 153c(id, seg, out_off, struct_off): the object struct is
at param_2:param_4 (param_2 = the segment = DGROUP 0x1c00 in every caller; param_4 = the near offset),
NOT a host pointer.  Ghidra dropped the ES=param_2 base (typed param_4 as a host `int *` -> deref of the
bare offset 0xe816 = SIGSEGV) AND folded the descriptor loop's walking DS (= the resource segment
